{"headword":"פָּרָה³","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f. heifer, cow</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.7\">Is 11:7</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּרָתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 21:10\" href=\"/Job.21.10\">Jb 21:10</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:16\" href=\"/Genesis.32.16\">Gn 32:16</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּרֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:26\" href=\"/Genesis.41.26\">41:26</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 4:1\" href=\"/Amos.4.1\">Am 4:1</a>;—as gift <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:16\" href=\"/Genesis.32.16\">Gn 32:16</a>; in Pharaoh’s dream <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:2\" href=\"/Genesis.41.2\">41:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:3\" href=\"/Genesis.41.3\">3</a><sup>(×2)</sup> + 8 times <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:41\" href=\"/Genesis.41.41\">41</a>; drawing cart <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 6:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.6.7\">1 S 6:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 6:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.6.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 6:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.6.14\">14</a> + <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳ עָלוֹת</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 6:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.6.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 6:10\" href=\"/I_Samuel.6.10\">10</a> <em>cows giving suck</em>, milch cows; <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳</span> calving <a data-ref=\"Job 21:10\" href=\"/Job.21.10\">Jb 21:10</a>, grazing <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.7\">Is 11:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳ אֲדֻמָּה</span> <em>red heifer</em> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 19:2\" href=\"/Numbers.19.2\">Nu 19:2</a>, cf. v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 19:5\" href=\"/Numbers.19.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 19:6\" href=\"/Numbers.19.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 19:9\" href=\"/Numbers.19.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 19:10\" href=\"/Numbers.19.10\">10</a>; sim. of stubbornness <a data-ref=\"Hosea 4:16\" href=\"/Hosea.4.16\">Ho 4:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּרוֹת הַבָּשָׁן</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 4:1\" href=\"/Amos.4.1\">Am 4:1</a>, fig. of luxurious women."}]},"rid":"BDB08116","strong_numbers":["6509","6510","6511"],"next_hw":"פָּרָה⁴","prev_hw":"פַּר²","ordinal":"I.","occurrences":"26","quotes":[],"GK":["7238","7239","7240"],"TWOT":["1809","1831b"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}